SUMMARY:Fall Social - RLadies+ Santa Barbara
DESCRIPTION:Hi everyone!\n\nJoin us for an informal social gathering at UC Santa Barbara to reconnect, catch up, and meet others in the R community. We’ll gather at Decker’s Deck at UC Santa Barbara with some light refreshments and some R-inspired mingling activities while we soak up the ocean views.\n\nEveryone is welcome - whether you’ve joined us for a meetup in the past, or are curious to meet like-minded individuals and learn more about our group, this event is for you!\n\n📍 Where: Bren Hall, Decker’s Deck, UC Santa Barbara\n📅 When: Wednesday, October 7, 4:30–6:30 pm\n\nLooking forward to seeing you all!\nDanielle, Camila, and Colleen
LOCATION:Bren Hall, Bren Hall, 2400 University of California, Santa Barbara, CA 93117, USA, Santa Barbara, UNITED STATES OF AMERICA
URL:https://www.meetup.com/rladies-santa-barbara/events/316699192/
